{
  "title": "Max Area of Island",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "type": "matrix",
  "tags": [
    "Array",
    "Depth-First Search",
    "Matrix"
  ],
  "description": "Find the maximum area of an island in a 2D binary grid, where an island is a group of 1s connected 4-directionally.",
  "target": 5,
  "pseudocode": "1. function maxAreaOfIsland(grid):\n2.   maxArea = 0\n3.   for r in rows: for c in cols:\n4.     if grid[r][c] == 1:\n5.       maxArea = max(maxArea, dfs(grid, r, c))\n6.   return maxArea\n7. function dfs(grid, r, c):\n8.   if (invalid r, c or grid[r][c] == 0): return 0\n9.   grid[r][c] = 0\n10.  return 1 + dfs(r+1,c) + dfs(r-1,c) + dfs(r,c+1) + dfs(r,c-1)",
